    "也可以创建定义、导入版本包，或刷新官方目录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a definition, import a package, or refresh the official catalog."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以创建定义、导入版本包，或刷新官方目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅保存候选，不替换或自动晋升基线": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save independently; no replacement or automatic promotion"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保存候选，不替换或自动晋升基线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从智能体库选择已有定义，或先创建一份用户副本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a definition from the library or create a user copy first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从智能体库选择已有定义，或先创建一份用户副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存在本机，不参与同步和评分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stored on this Mac; excluded from sync and scoring"
